license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/frame-controller-sim"
abstract: >-
  A SteamVR virtual-controller driver and pose feeder that add companion pens
  beside the real Steam Frame controllers, so the system draws alongside a
  person for annotation of drawing and annotation grading (RFD 2287). The pens
  are real SteamVR tracked devices on the non-conflicting vive-tracker object
  roles, moved by a pose feeder through shared memory.
